        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winona%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1962 the Winona Tigers captured the Kansas State Boys Class BB Basketball title, and the girls won Class 1A Volleyball in 1971 and 1972.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
